# Rust build artifacts
/target/
**/target/
Cargo.lock.bak

# Task 20 (builder B3): the E2E fixture target project is a committed fixture,
# not a build artifact — un-ignore exactly this one directory that the
# `**/target/` rule above would otherwise swallow wholesale.
!tests/fixtures/target/

# Local environment overrides (spec §8.1: secrets by indirection only, never committed)
.env
.env.local

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Runtime state, evidence, and workspace roots are configuration-defined
# (GAUNTLET_STATE_DIR / GAUNTLET_ARTIFACT_DIR / GAUNTLET_TMP_DIR / workspace.root,
# spec §8.3/§8.6). Their default paths are fixed in Task 5's defaults table; entries
# below are added there rather than guessed here so this file never lags the actual
# defaults.

.tmp/

# Task 17: the roles lock is RUNTIME-OWNED host state written by
# `gauntlet roles install` (per-harness, per-host digests) — never a
# committed artifact; `just doctor` and tests create their own under
# temp roots.
.gauntlet/roles.lock